{"id":"616416","name":"红糖红枣糯米饭","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/616416/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"糯米","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"玫瑰红糖","amount":"两块"},{"name":"去核红枣","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"糯米适量。","img":"images/616416/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"淘洗干净，清水浸泡。","img":"images/616416/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"浸泡了一夜的糯米。","img":"images/616416/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"怕夹生，糯米在锅里煮了5，6分钟。","img":"images/616416/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"捞出控水。","img":"images/616416/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"去核红枣泡30分钟。","img":"images/616416/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"一切为二。","img":"images/616416/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"玫瑰红糖开水化开。","img":"images/616416/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"红枣摆在碗底，中间切了一片胡萝卜花点缀一下。","img":"images/616416/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"铺上一层糯米。","img":"images/616416/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再摆一层红枣。","img":"images/616416/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"再铺上一层大米，中间挖个大点的窝。","img":"images/616416/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"红糖水倒入碗里。","img":"images/616416/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"冷水上屉，中火蒸40分钟。","img":"images/616416/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"时间到，开盖。扣上一个盘子。","img":"images/616416/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"倒扣盘中，用抹布垫着把碗取下。","img":"images/616416/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/616416/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/616416/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}